                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "KeeperRL is a more welcoming and affordable Dwarf Fortress. It possesses the charm and gameplay mechanics that rival those of its peers. If you seek a colony sim with Z levels, the ability to build inside mountains or in the wild, added optionality to be as relaxing or as unforgiving as you like, get it before you spend $100 on something similar.. You won't regret it. Pick it up on sale if you like. You wouldn't have to wait too long.",
